# Copy to .env (gitignored) and run with `uv run --env-file .env agent.py ...`. Variables already set in the
# environment win. The test suite never reads this file and never calls a model.

# Where requests go: none (print the first request), anthropic or openai.
DOCS_QA_PROVIDER=openai

# Who is signed in: u_ada (default, Owner), u_ben (Member) or u_cho (Admin), from data/accounts.json.
# DOCS_QA_USER=u_ada

# The account-agent route names its model per provider in policy/routes.json: claude-opus-5-5 for anthropic, and
# gpt-oss-120b on Groq for openai. DOCS_QA_MODEL sends to another model on the endpoint OPENAI_BASE_URL names.
# DOCS_QA_MODEL=

# The Claude API. Or leave the key unset after `ant auth login`.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# The openai route's endpoint, Groq, reads its key from here (api_key_env in policy/routes.json).
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...

# An OpenAI-compatible server for --model, such as a local one.
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
